{"id":"e52c51129983b282b76ad42e449030f2bb5d066b","url":"https://www.rise-reforming.com/","title":"Home | Rise Reforming","site_name":"Zeli","source":"Hacker News · 24h最热","byline":null,"excerpt":"We convert domestic raw biogas into chemicals, removing the reliance on fossil fuels and vulnerable supply chains.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><DIV data-main-content-parent=\"true\" id=\"PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox40tc6\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\" data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\"><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tc6/comp-mox40tc82/comp-mox425ay/comp-mox425b7/comp-mox425eo/comp-mox425eq2/comp-mox425md\"><P data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mox425md\"><h2>Unlocking resilience<br>\nfor the chemical industry</h2></P></interact-element><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox6vjmq\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\" data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\"><!--$--><P data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mox8wbvg\"><h2>We convert stranded biogas from wastewater plants, farms, and landfills on-site into valuable chemicals like dimethyl ether (DME), methanol, and dimethyl carbonate (DMC)</h2></P><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox40tcj\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\" data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\"><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mp5nviye\"><div id=\"comp-mp5nviye\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><P data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mp5nvizz3\"><h5><span>Supply-Secure</span></h5></P><!--/$--><!--$--><p>We convert domestic raw biogas into chemicals, removing the reliance on fossil fuels and vulnerable supply chains.</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mox6gohk5\"><div id=\"comp-mox6gohk5\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><P data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mox6goi31\"><h5><span>Modular</span></h5></P><!--/$--><!--$--><p>Our technology fits inside a shipping container, allowing for rapid and in-situ deployment, quicker payback, streamlined permitting, and access to the cheapest biogas.</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mox6goim6\"><div id=\"comp-mox6goim6\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><P data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mox6goj43\"><h5><span>Scalable</span></h5></P><!--/$--><!--$--><p>We can scale with your facility, easily adding or subtracting modules, ensuring long-term financial growth.</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mox6gogg5\"><div id=\"comp-mox6gogg5\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><P data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mox6goh03\"><h5><span>Price Competitive</span></h5></P><!--/$--><!--$--><p>Our proprietary process enables us to produce DME that competes pricewise with petrochemical DME and the cheapest green methanol &amp; DMC available.</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mox6gof83\"><div id=\"comp-mox6gof83\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox6gofp3\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><P data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mox6goft3\"><h5><span>Low-Carbon</span></h5></P><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><p>Our modules utilize waste gases to produce chemicals without the extraction, processing, and transportation of fossil fuels as raw materials.</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwau\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\" data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwbf\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mrc7xiia\"><div id=\"comp-mrc7xiia\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p>Pilot&#160;container has arrived at our host site (Chicagoland wastewater plant), officially kicking off construction.</p><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><p>July 2026</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mrc7xiot\" id=\"comp-mrc7xiot\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mrc7xiot\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mrc7xiot&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;module shot website.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;f82708_c78bd5e8d3094257a3c13e93180853fe~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1300,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mrc833ci&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;module shot website.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;nlc-1543&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;width&quot;:1300,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/f82708_c78bd5e8d3094257a3c13e93180853fe~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1300,h_1300,al_c,q_85,enc_auto/f82708_c78bd5e8d3094257a3c13e93180853fe~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mrc7xiot\"><picture><img alt=\"module shot website.jpg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mpe5fvzh\"><div id=\"comp-mpe5fvzh\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p>Rise Reforming joins Y Combinator’s S26 batch to accelerate scale-up and time to market.</p><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><p>May 2026</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mpe5fw5y\" id=\"comp-mpe5fw5y\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mpe5fw5y\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mpe5fw5y&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Screenshot 2026-05-18 at 1.13.44 PM.png&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_180678d2f2894ec3831aab4f51df7b16~mv2.png&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:500,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mpe5iu2b&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Screenshot 2026-05-18 at 1.13.44 PM.png&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;a4x-718&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;width&quot;:502,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_180678d2f2894ec3831aab4f51df7b16~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_502,h_500,al_c,q_85,enc_auto/4e3194_180678d2f2894ec3831aab4f51df7b16~mv2.png&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mpe5fw5y\"><picture><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-05-18 at 1.13.44 PM.png\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp2ykwbo\"><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwbo\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p><span>Signed a binding supply agreement and multiple MOUs with biogas producers. Signed a conditional DME offtake agreement for our first commercial unit.</span></p><!--/$--><!--$--><p>April 2026</p><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp2ykwc6\"><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwc6\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp341znm\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><blockquote><span>Proof-of-concept complete after 1800+ hours of stable syngas production. Next, with pilot plant designs ready, we're taking our technology to live biogas.</span></blockquote></div><!--/$--><!--$--><p>March 2026</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mp2ykwcj\" id=\"comp-mp2ykwcj\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mp2ykwcj\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mp2ykwcj&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;IIT_lab.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_63587d5b8f194f13a890ef9bbdadc9db~mv2.jpeg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:2868,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mp35asmt&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;IIT_lab.jpeg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;jps-19379&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;crop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:67,&quot;y&quot;:92,&quot;width&quot;:2318,&quot;height&quot;:2127},&quot;width&quot;:3024,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_63587d5b8f194f13a890ef9bbdadc9db~mv2.jpeg/v1/crop/x_67,y_92,w_2318,h_2127/fill/w_2318,h_2127,al_c,q_90,enc_auto/4e3194_63587d5b8f194f13a890ef9bbdadc9db~mv2.jpeg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mp2ykwcj\"><picture><img alt=\"IIT_lab.jpeg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp5qj7dm\"><div id=\"comp-mp5qj7dm\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp5qj7eb3\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><blockquote><span>Pre-seed round of funding closed ($650k) towards completing proof-of-concept, filing process IP, and finalizing our plans for the pilot plant.</span></blockquote></div><!--/$--><!--$--><p>December 2025</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mp5qj7ep\" id=\"comp-mp5qj7ep\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mp5qj7ep\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mp5qj7ep&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;FirstStep.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_122e8c866f05401bbfbfbc5a4368fe4c~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:920,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mp5rv7es&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;FirstStep.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;a5m-4431&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;crop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:89,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;width&quot;:1004,&quot;height&quot;:920},&quot;width&quot;:1380,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_122e8c866f05401bbfbfbc5a4368fe4c~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_89,y_0,w_1004,h_920/fill/w_1004,h_920,al_c,q_85,enc_auto/4e3194_122e8c866f05401bbfbfbc5a4368fe4c~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mp5qj7ep\"><picture><img alt=\"FirstStep.jpg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp2ykwcm9\"><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwcm9\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwcr\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><blockquote><span>Rise Reforming plants its roots at Illinois Institute of Technology's incubator lab to continue R&amp;D. Nina Kritikos joins as the first hire.</span></blockquote></div><!--/$--><!--$--><p>August 2025</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mp2ykwcx5\" id=\"comp-mp2ykwcx5\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mp2ykwcx5\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mp2ykwcx5&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Nina_IIT.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_079a86f9cce8402a818a689cd934c829~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1661,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mp359qcd&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Nina_IIT.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;jps-19372&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;crop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:35,&quot;width&quot;:1576,&quot;height&quot;:1444},&quot;width&quot;:1576,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_079a86f9cce8402a818a689cd934c829~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_35,w_1576,h_1444/fill/w_1576,h_1444,al_c,q_90,enc_auto/4e3194_079a86f9cce8402a818a689cd934c829~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mp2ykwcx5\"><picture><img alt=\"Nina_IIT.jpg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp33z0b7\"><div id=\"comp-mp33z0b7\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p><span>Funding secured from UChicago accelerators. CEO George Rose named Climate Fellow by the 776 Foundation, led by Reddit Co-Founder Alexis Ohanian.&#160;</span></p><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><p>May 2025</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mp33z0bj\" id=\"comp-mp33z0bj\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mp33z0bj\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mp33z0bj&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;News2.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_9b340bca6bbd4e979c932e1b344d4dcb~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1536,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mp358uq6&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;News2.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;jps-19366&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;width&quot;:1536,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_9b340bca6bbd4e979c932e1b344d4dcb~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1536,h_1536,al_c,q_90,enc_auto/4e3194_9b340bca6bbd4e979c932e1b344d4dcb~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mp33z0bj\"><picture><img alt=\"News2.jpg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp33zhlx\"><div id=\"comp-mp33zhlx\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p><span>The team takes home the European Aerosols Federation 2025 Start-Up Award and breaks boundaries as the youngest presenters at Paris Packaging Week.</span></p><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><p>January 2025</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mp33zhm8\" id=\"comp-mp33zhm8\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mp33zhm8\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mp33zhm8&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Paris.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_0b5f6b854097405eb4938a81b1c3c87c~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1536,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mp35bsug&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Paris.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;jps-19381&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;width&quot;:1536,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_0b5f6b854097405eb4938a81b1c3c87c~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1536,h_1536,al_c,q_90,enc_auto/4e3194_0b5f6b854097405eb4938a81b1c3c87c~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mp33zhm8\"><picture><img alt=\"Paris.jpg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwd12\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><P data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mp2ykwd34\"><h2>Latest</h2></P><!--/$--><!--$--><p><span>Here's what we've been up to</span></p><!--/$--></div><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox40tcp\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\" data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\"><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcp/comp-mox40tcr5/comp-mox42d8k\"><div id=\"comp-mox42d8k\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox42d9o\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcp/comp-mox40tcr5/comp-mox42d8k/comp-mox42d8m/comp-mox42d9o/comp-mox42d9q/comp-mox42da6\"><P data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mox42da6\"><h2><span>Partner With Us</span></h2></P></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox42dae\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcp/comp-mox40tcr5/comp-mox42d8k/comp-mox42d8m/comp-mox42d9o/comp-mox42d9q/comp-mox42dae/comp-mox42daf3/comp-mox42dau\"><p><span>We are looking for visionary collaborators and investors to scale our low-carbon chemical production.&#160;</span></p></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcp/comp-mox40tcr5/comp-mox42d8k/comp-mox42d8m/comp-mox42d9o/comp-mox42d9q/comp-mox42dae/comp-mox42daf3/comp-mrcbbmef\"></interact-element><!--/$--></div><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-hook=\"tpa-components-provider\" id=\"comp-mox42dc3\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><form aria-label=\"Contact Us Form\" id=\"form-a1dbb3b5-b223-4530-9576-62357f55acc5\" data-hook=\"form-a1dbb3b5-b223-4530-9576-62357f55acc5\"><fieldset><div data-hook=\"form-root\" dir=\"\"><div><p><label id=\"form-field-label-1005ee19-2c51-4781-f3e9-943733b354aa-comp-mox42dcn-\" for=\"form-field-input-1005ee19-2c51-4781-f3e9-943733b354aa-comp-mox42dcn-\">First Name</label></p><p><label id=\"form-field-label-a917a5ee-a5db-4ca5-d49a-3ab517449c6a-comp-mox42dcn-\" for=\"form-field-input-a917a5ee-a5db-4ca5-d49a-3ab517449c6a-comp-mox42dcn-\">Last Name</label></p></div><div><p><label id=\"form-field-label-1d1a3ac0-478e-495e-38f8-4d08db8dacc5-comp-mox42dcn-\" for=\"form-field-input-1d1a3ac0-478e-495e-38f8-4d08db8dacc5-comp-mox42dcn-\">Email Address</label></p></div><div><p><label id=\"form-field-label-0e11cbe5-d3c0-486d-73d2-61bc97a69276-comp-mox42dcn-\" for=\"form-field-input-0e11cbe5-d3c0-486d-73d2-61bc97a69276-comp-mox42dcn-\">Message</label></p></div></div></fieldset></form></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--></div><!--/$--></DIV></DIV>","content_text":"Unlocking resilience for the chemical industryWe convert stranded biogas from wastewater plants, farms, and landfills on-site into valuable chemicals like dimethyl ether (DME), methanol, and dimethyl carbonate (DMC)Supply-SecureWe convert domestic raw biogas into chemicals, removing the reliance on fossil fuels and vulnerable supply chains.ModularOur technology fits inside a shipping container, allowing for rapid and in-situ deployment, quicker payback, streamlined permitting, and access to the cheapest biogas.ScalableWe can scale with your facility, easily adding or subtracting modules, ensuring long-term financial growth.Price CompetitiveOur proprietary process enables us to produce DME that competes pricewise with petrochemical DME and the cheapest green methanol & DMC available.Low-CarbonOur modules utilize waste gases to produce chemicals without the extraction, processing, and transportation of fossil fuels as raw materials.Pilot container has arrived at our host site (Chicagoland wastewater plant), officially kicking off construction.July 2026Rise Reforming joins Y Combinator’s S26 batch to accelerate scale-up and time to market.May 2026Signed a binding supply agreement and multiple MOUs with biogas producers. Signed a conditional DME offtake agreement for our first commercial unit.April 2026Proof-of-concept complete after 1800+ hours of stable syngas production. Next, with pilot plant designs ready, we're taking our technology to live biogas.March 2026Pre-seed round of funding closed ($650k) towards completing proof-of-concept, filing process IP, and finalizing our plans for the pilot plant.December 2025Rise Reforming plants its roots at Illinois Institute of Technology's incubator lab to continue R&D. Nina Kritikos joins as the first hire.August 2025Funding secured from UChicago accelerators. CEO George Rose named Climate Fellow by the 776 Foundation, led by Reddit Co-Founder Alexis Ohanian. May 2025The team takes home the European Aerosols Federation 2025 Start-Up Award and breaks boundaries as the youngest presenters at Paris Packaging Week.January 2025LatestHere's what we've been up toPartner With UsWe are looking for visionary collaborators and investors to scale our low-carbon chemical production. First NameLast NameEmail AddressMessage","fetched_at":"2026-07-28T18:33:56.539Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<h2>Unlocking resilience<br>\nfor the chemical industry</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Unlocking resilience for the chemical industry","zh":"释放化学工业的弹性"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>We convert stranded biogas from wastewater plants, farms, and landfills on-site into valuable chemicals like dimethyl ether (DME), methanol, and dimethyl carbonate (DMC)</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"We convert stranded biogas from wastewater plants, farms, and landfills on-site into valuable chemicals like dimethyl ether (DME), methanol, and dimethyl carbonate (DMC)","zh":"我们将来自废水处理厂、农场和垃圾填埋场的滞留沼气现场转化为有价值的化学品，如二甲醚 (DME)、甲醇和碳酸二甲酯 (DMC)"}]},{"html_en":"<h5><span>Supply-Secure</span></h5>","sentences":[{"en":"Supply-Secure","zh":"供应安全"}]},{"html_en":"<p>We convert domestic raw biogas into chemicals, removing the reliance on fossil fuels and vulnerable supply chains.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"We convert domestic raw biogas into chemicals, removing the reliance on fossil fuels and vulnerable supply chains.","zh":"我们将国内的原始沼气转化为化学品，消除对化石燃料和脆弱供应链的依赖。"}]},{"html_en":"<h5><span>Modular</span></h5>","sentences":[{"en":"Modular","zh":"模块化的"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Our technology fits inside a shipping container, allowing for rapid and in-situ deployment, quicker payback, streamlined permitting, and access to the cheapest biogas.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Our technology fits inside a shipping container, allowing for rapid and in-situ deployment, quicker payback, streamlined permitting, and access to the cheapest biogas.","zh":"我们的技术适合装在集装箱内，可实现快速原位部署、更快的投资回报、简化许可流程并获得最便宜的沼气。"}]},{"html_en":"<h5><span>Scalable</span></h5>","sentences":[{"en":"Scalable","zh":"可扩展"}]},{"html_en":"<p>We can scale with your facility, easily adding or subtracting modules, ensuring long-term financial growth.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"We can scale with your facility, easily adding or subtracting modules, ensuring long-term financial growth.","zh":"我们可以根据您的设施进行扩展，轻松添加或减少模块，确保长期财务增长。"}]},{"html_en":"<h5><span>Price Competitive</span></h5>","sentences":[{"en":"Price Competitive","zh":"价格有竞争力"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Our proprietary process enables us to produce DME that competes pricewise with petrochemical DME and the cheapest green methanol &amp; DMC available.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Our proprietary process enables us to produce DME that competes pricewise with petrochemical DME and the cheapest green methanol & DMC available.","zh":"我们的专有工艺使我们能够生产在价格上与石化 DME 以及最便宜的绿色甲醇和 DMC 竞争的 DME。"}]},{"html_en":"<h5><span>Low-Carbon</span></h5>","sentences":[{"en":"Low-Carbon","zh":"低碳"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Our modules utilize waste gases to produce chemicals without the extraction, processing, and transportation of fossil fuels as raw materials.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Our modules utilize waste gases to produce chemicals without the extraction, processing, and transportation of fossil fuels as raw materials.","zh":"我们的模块利用废气生产化学品，无需提取、加工和运输化石燃料作为原材料。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Pilot&#160;container has arrived at our host site (Chicagoland wastewater plant), officially kicking off construction.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Pilot container has arrived at our host site (Chicagoland wastewater plant), officially kicking off construction.","zh":"试点集装箱已抵达我们的主站（芝加哥污水处理厂），正式开始施工。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>July 2026</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>Rise Reforming joins Y Combinator’s S26 batch to accelerate scale-up and time to market.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Rise Reforming joins Y Combinator’s S26 batch to accelerate scale-up and time to market.","zh":"Rise Reforming 加入 Y Combinator 的 S26 批次，以加快规模扩大和上市时间。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>May 2026</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>Signed a binding supply agreement and multiple MOUs with biogas producers. Signed a conditional DME offtake agreement for our first commercial unit.</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Signed a binding supply agreement and multiple MOUs with biogas producers.","zh":"与沼气生产商签署了具有约束力的供应协议和多个谅解备忘录。"},{"en":"Signed a conditional DME offtake agreement for our first commercial unit.","zh":"签署了我们第一个商业装置的有条件 DME 承购协议。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>April 2026</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<blockquote><span>Proof-of-concept complete after 1800+ hours of stable syngas production. Next, with pilot plant designs ready, we're taking our technology to live biogas.</span></blockquote>","sentences":[{"en":"Proof-of-concept complete after 1800+ hours of stable syngas production.","zh":"经过 1800 多个小时的稳定合成气生产后，概念验证完成。"},{"en":"Next, with pilot plant designs ready, we're taking our technology to live biogas.","zh":"接下来，随着试点工厂设计的准备就绪，我们将把我们的技术应用于生活沼气。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>March 2026</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<blockquote><span>Pre-seed round of funding closed ($650k) towards completing proof-of-concept, filing process IP, and finalizing our plans for the pilot plant.</span></blockquote>","sentences":[{"en":"Pre-seed round of funding closed ($650k) towards completing proof-of-concept, filing process IP, and finalizing our plans for the pilot plant.","zh":"种子前轮融资已结束（65 万美元），用于完成概念验证、提交流程知识产权并最终确定我们的试点工厂计划。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>December 2025</p>","sentences":[{"en":"December 2025","zh":"2025年12月"}]},{"html_en":"<blockquote><span>Rise Reforming plants its roots at Illinois Institute of Technology's incubator lab to continue R&amp;D. Nina Kritikos joins as the first hire.</span></blockquote>","sentences":[{"en":"Rise Reforming plants its roots at Illinois Institute of Technology's incubator lab to continue R&D.","zh":"Rise Reforming 扎根于伊利诺伊理工学院的孵化器实验室，继续研发。"},{"en":"Nina Kritikos joins as the first hire.","zh":"Nina Kritikos 作为第一位员工加入。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>August 2025</p>","sentences":[{"en":"August 2025","zh":"2025 年 8 月"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>Funding secured from UChicago accelerators. CEO George Rose named Climate Fellow by the 776 Foundation, led by Reddit Co-Founder Alexis Ohanian.&#160;</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Funding secured from UChicago accelerators.","zh":"由芝加哥大学加速器提供的资金。"},{"en":"CEO George Rose named Climate Fellow by the 776 Foundation, led by Reddit Co-Founder Alexis Ohanian.","zh":"首席执行官 George Rose 被 Reddit 联合创始人 Alexis Ohanian 领导的 776 基金会任命为气候研究员。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>May 2025</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>The team takes home the European Aerosols Federation 2025 Start-Up Award and breaks boundaries as the youngest presenters at Paris Packaging Week.</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"The team takes home the European Aerosols Federation 2025 Start-Up Award and breaks boundaries as the youngest presenters at Paris Packaging Week.","zh":"该团队荣获欧洲气雾剂联合会 2025 年初创公司奖，并作为巴黎包装周上最年轻的演讲者打破界限。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>January 2025</p>","sentences":[{"en":"January 2025","zh":"2025 年 1 月"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Latest</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Latest","zh":"最新的"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>Here's what we've been up to</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Here's what we've been up to","zh":"这就是我们一直在做的事情"}]},{"html_en":"<h2><span>Partner With Us</span></h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Partner With Us","zh":"与我们合作"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>We are looking for visionary collaborators and investors to scale our low-carbon chemical production.&#160;</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"We are looking for visionary collaborators and investors to scale our low-carbon chemical production.","zh":"我们正在寻找有远见的合作者和投资者来扩大我们的低碳化学品生产。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><label id=\"form-field-label-1005ee19-2c51-4781-f3e9-943733b354aa-comp-mox42dcn-\" for=\"form-field-input-1005ee19-2c51-4781-f3e9-943733b354aa-comp-mox42dcn-\">First Name</label></p>","sentences":[{"en":"First Name","zh":"名"}]},{"html_en":"<p><label id=\"form-field-label-a917a5ee-a5db-4ca5-d49a-3ab517449c6a-comp-mox42dcn-\" for=\"form-field-input-a917a5ee-a5db-4ca5-d49a-3ab517449c6a-comp-mox42dcn-\">Last Name</label></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Last Name","zh":"姓"}]},{"html_en":"<p><label id=\"form-field-label-1d1a3ac0-478e-495e-38f8-4d08db8dacc5-comp-mox42dcn-\" for=\"form-field-input-1d1a3ac0-478e-495e-38f8-4d08db8dacc5-comp-mox42dcn-\">Email Address</label></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Email Address","zh":"电子邮件"}]},{"html_en":"<p><label id=\"form-field-label-0e11cbe5-d3c0-486d-73d2-61bc97a69276-comp-mox42dcn-\" for=\"form-field-input-0e11cbe5-d3c0-486d-73d2-61bc97a69276-comp-mox42dcn-\">Message</label></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Message","zh":"信息"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div data-main-content-parent=\"true\" id=\"PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox40tc6\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\" data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\"><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tc6/comp-mox40tc82/comp-mox425ay/comp-mox425b7/comp-mox425eo/comp-mox425eq2/comp-mox425md\"><p data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mox425md\"></p><h2>释放化学工业的弹性</h2><p></p></interact-element><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox6vjmq\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\" data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\"><!--$--><p data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mox8wbvg\"></p><h2>我们将来自废水处理厂、农场和垃圾填埋场的滞留沼气现场转化为有价值的化学品，如二甲醚 (DME)、甲醇和碳酸二甲酯 (DMC)</h2><p></p><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox40tcj\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\" data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\"><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mp5nviye\"><div id=\"comp-mp5nviye\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mp5nvizz3\"></p><h5>供应安全</h5><p></p><!--/$--><!--$--><p>我们将国内的原始沼气转化为化学品，消除对化石燃料和脆弱供应链的依赖。</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mox6gohk5\"><div id=\"comp-mox6gohk5\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mox6goi31\"></p><h5>模块化的</h5><p></p><!--/$--><!--$--><p>我们的技术适合装在集装箱内，可实现快速原位部署、更快的投资回报、简化许可流程并获得最便宜的沼气。</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mox6goim6\"><div id=\"comp-mox6goim6\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mox6goj43\"></p><h5>可扩展</h5><p></p><!--/$--><!--$--><p>我们可以根据您的设施进行扩展，轻松添加或减少模块，确保长期财务增长。</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mox6gogg5\"><div id=\"comp-mox6gogg5\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mox6goh03\"></p><h5>价格有竞争力</h5><p></p><!--/$--><!--$--><p>我们的专有工艺使我们能够生产在价格上与石化 DME 以及最便宜的绿色甲醇和 DMC 竞争的 DME。</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mox6gof83\"><div id=\"comp-mox6gof83\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox6gofp3\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mox6goft3\"></p><h5>低碳</h5><p></p><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><p>我们的模块利用废气生产化学品，无需提取、加工和运输化石燃料作为原材料。</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwau\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\" data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwbf\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mrc7xiia\"><div id=\"comp-mrc7xiia\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p>试点集装箱已抵达我们的主站（芝加哥污水处理厂），正式开始施工。</p><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><p>July 2026</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mrc7xiot\" id=\"comp-mrc7xiot\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mrc7xiot\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mrc7xiot&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;module shot website.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;f82708_c78bd5e8d3094257a3c13e93180853fe~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1300,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mrc833ci&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;module shot website.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;nlc-1543&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;width&quot;:1300,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/f82708_c78bd5e8d3094257a3c13e93180853fe~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1300,h_1300,al_c,q_85,enc_auto/f82708_c78bd5e8d3094257a3c13e93180853fe~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mrc7xiot\"><picture><img alt=\"module shot website.jpg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mpe5fvzh\"><div id=\"comp-mpe5fvzh\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p>Rise Reforming 加入 Y Combinator 的 S26 批次，以加快规模扩大和上市时间。</p><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><p>May 2026</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mpe5fw5y\" id=\"comp-mpe5fw5y\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mpe5fw5y\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mpe5fw5y&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Screenshot 2026-05-18 at 1.13.44 PM.png&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_180678d2f2894ec3831aab4f51df7b16~mv2.png&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:500,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mpe5iu2b&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Screenshot 2026-05-18 at 1.13.44 PM.png&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;a4x-718&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;width&quot;:502,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_180678d2f2894ec3831aab4f51df7b16~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_502,h_500,al_c,q_85,enc_auto/4e3194_180678d2f2894ec3831aab4f51df7b16~mv2.png&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mpe5fw5y\"><picture><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-05-18 at 1.13.44 PM.png\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp2ykwbo\"><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwbo\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p>与沼气生产商签署了具有约束力的供应协议和多个谅解备忘录。 签署了我们第一个商业装置的有条件 DME 承购协议。</p><!--/$--><!--$--><p>April 2026</p><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp2ykwc6\"><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwc6\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp341znm\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><blockquote>经过 1800 多个小时的稳定合成气生产后，概念验证完成。 接下来，随着试点工厂设计的准备就绪，我们将把我们的技术应用于生活沼气。</blockquote></div><!--/$--><!--$--><p>March 2026</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mp2ykwcj\" id=\"comp-mp2ykwcj\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mp2ykwcj\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mp2ykwcj&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;IIT_lab.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_63587d5b8f194f13a890ef9bbdadc9db~mv2.jpeg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:2868,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mp35asmt&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;IIT_lab.jpeg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;jps-19379&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;crop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:67,&quot;y&quot;:92,&quot;width&quot;:2318,&quot;height&quot;:2127},&quot;width&quot;:3024,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_63587d5b8f194f13a890ef9bbdadc9db~mv2.jpeg/v1/crop/x_67,y_92,w_2318,h_2127/fill/w_2318,h_2127,al_c,q_90,enc_auto/4e3194_63587d5b8f194f13a890ef9bbdadc9db~mv2.jpeg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mp2ykwcj\"><picture><img alt=\"IIT_lab.jpeg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp5qj7dm\"><div id=\"comp-mp5qj7dm\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp5qj7eb3\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><blockquote>种子前轮融资已结束（65 万美元），用于完成概念验证、提交流程知识产权并最终确定我们的试点工厂计划。</blockquote></div><!--/$--><!--$--><p>2025年12月</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mp5qj7ep\" id=\"comp-mp5qj7ep\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mp5qj7ep\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mp5qj7ep&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;FirstStep.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_122e8c866f05401bbfbfbc5a4368fe4c~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:920,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mp5rv7es&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;FirstStep.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;a5m-4431&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;crop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:89,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;width&quot;:1004,&quot;height&quot;:920},&quot;width&quot;:1380,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_122e8c866f05401bbfbfbc5a4368fe4c~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_89,y_0,w_1004,h_920/fill/w_1004,h_920,al_c,q_85,enc_auto/4e3194_122e8c866f05401bbfbfbc5a4368fe4c~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mp5qj7ep\"><picture><img alt=\"FirstStep.jpg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp2ykwcm9\"><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwcm9\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwcr\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><blockquote>Rise Reforming 扎根于伊利诺伊理工学院的孵化器实验室，继续研发。 Nina Kritikos 作为第一位员工加入。</blockquote></div><!--/$--><!--$--><p>2025 年 8 月</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mp2ykwcx5\" id=\"comp-mp2ykwcx5\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mp2ykwcx5\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mp2ykwcx5&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Nina_IIT.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_079a86f9cce8402a818a689cd934c829~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1661,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mp359qcd&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Nina_IIT.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;jps-19372&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;crop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:35,&quot;width&quot;:1576,&quot;height&quot;:1444},&quot;width&quot;:1576,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_079a86f9cce8402a818a689cd934c829~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_35,w_1576,h_1444/fill/w_1576,h_1444,al_c,q_90,enc_auto/4e3194_079a86f9cce8402a818a689cd934c829~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mp2ykwcx5\"><picture><img alt=\"Nina_IIT.jpg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp33z0b7\"><div id=\"comp-mp33z0b7\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p>由芝加哥大学加速器提供的资金。 首席执行官 George Rose 被 Reddit 联合创始人 Alexis Ohanian 领导的 776 基金会任命为气候研究员。</p><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><p>May 2025</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mp33z0bj\" id=\"comp-mp33z0bj\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mp33z0bj\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mp33z0bj&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;News2.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_9b340bca6bbd4e979c932e1b344d4dcb~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1536,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mp358uq6&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;News2.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;jps-19366&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;width&quot;:1536,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_9b340bca6bbd4e979c932e1b344d4dcb~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1536,h_1536,al_c,q_90,enc_auto/4e3194_9b340bca6bbd4e979c932e1b344d4dcb~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mp33z0bj\"><picture><img alt=\"News2.jpg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp33zhlx\"><div id=\"comp-mp33zhlx\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p>该团队荣获欧洲气雾剂联合会 2025 年初创公司奖，并作为巴黎包装周上最年轻的演讲者打破界限。</p><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><p>2025 年 1 月</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mp33zhm8\" id=\"comp-mp33zhm8\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mp33zhm8\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mp33zhm8&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Paris.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_0b5f6b854097405eb4938a81b1c3c87c~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1536,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mp35bsug&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Paris.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;jps-19381&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;width&quot;:1536,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_0b5f6b854097405eb4938a81b1c3c87c~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1536,h_1536,al_c,q_90,enc_auto/4e3194_0b5f6b854097405eb4938a81b1c3c87c~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mp33zhm8\"><picture><img alt=\"Paris.jpg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwd12\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><p data-testid=\"richTextElement\" id=\"comp-mp2ykwd34\"></p><h2>最新的</h2><p></p><!--/$--><!--$--><p>这就是我们一直在做的事情</p><!--/$--></div><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox40tcp\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\" data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\"><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcp/comp-mox40tcr5/comp-mox42d8k\"><div id=\"comp-mox42d8k\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox42d9o\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcp/comp-mox40tcr5/comp-mox42d8k/comp-mox42d8m/comp-